pro_course_detail.description:
In this English speaking class, you will be able to enhance your ability to communicate in English. You will have the opportunity to practice your English, develop your grammar and build your vocabulary on any topic. 
If your goal is any of the following, then this class is for you:
•	Improve pronunciation and use of grammar in everyday speech; 
•	Expand your vocabulary on any specific topic;
•	Prepare for the speaking section in your IELTS exam; 
•	Prepare for a job interview;
•	Practice an oral presentation for school or work; 
•	Or simply be able to carry a conversation on books, culture, life or any other topic of interest.
